{"id":"c6ba906de9e259ac","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-ideal6-precipitous-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal6 Precipitous Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal6-precipitous-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Precipitous Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-precipitous-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal6-precipitous-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal6-precipitous-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Precipitous Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ideal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-precipitous-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-precipitous-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal6-precipitous-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Precipitous Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal I,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal I,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IdealPositive}:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{IdealPositive}:V^2\\to V\\)</span> is the relative positive-set carrier defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdealGameEmptyWinningStrategy}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{IdealGameEmptyWinningStrategy}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PrecipitousIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PrecipitousIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}positive\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{IdealPositive}(X,\\mathcal I)\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\mathcal I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}positive\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{IdealPositive}(X,\\mathcal I)\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\mathcal I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}empty\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IdealGameEmptyWinningStrategy}_S(\\sigma,X,\\mathcal I)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\n\\land\\exists H_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nH_E=\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\operatorname{IdealPositive}(X,\\mathcal I))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=2n\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(k+1\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\to s(k+1)\\subseteq s(k)))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,H_E,\\operatorname{IdealPositive}(X,\\mathcal I))\n\\land\\forall s\\in H_E\\;\\Bigl(\ns\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\sigma(s)\\subseteq s(\\operatorname{dom}(s)-1)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\operatorname{IdealPositive}(X,\\mathcal I))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(A(n+1)\\subseteq A(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\nA(2n)=\\sigma(A\\upharpoonright2n)\n\\to\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(A)=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}empty\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IdealGameEmptyWinningStrategy}_S(\\sigma,X,\\mathcal I)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\n\\land\\exists H_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nH_E=\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\operatorname{IdealPositive}(X,\\mathcal I))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=2n\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(k+1\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\to s(k+1)\\subseteq s(k)))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,H_E,\\operatorname{IdealPositive}(X,\\mathcal I))\n\\land\\forall s\\in H_E\\;\\Bigl(\ns\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\sigma(s)\\subseteq s(\\operatorname{dom}(s)-1)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\operatorname{IdealPositive}(X,\\mathcal I))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(A(n+1)\\subseteq A(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\nA(2n)=\\sigma(A\\upharpoonright2n)\n\\to\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(A)=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PrecipitousIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{IdealGameEmptyWinningStrategy}_S(\\sigma,X,\\mathcal I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PrecipitousIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{IdealGameEmptyWinningStrategy}_S(\\sigma,X,\\mathcal I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The positive-set carrier explicitly depends on both <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span>; it is no longer a subscripted abbreviation with a hidden base set.</li>\n<li>This is the standard ideal-game characterization of precipitousness. It is equivalent to well-foundedness of the generic ultrapower but does not misuse the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as a set-sized ground-model argument of the forcing relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"ta